  "all_ingredients_flat": "Lentil Tofu, capsicum, tomato, beetroot, carrot, vegetables of your choice, hing (asafoetida), turmeric powder, saunf powder (fennel seeds powder), ground black pepper, plant based yogurt, Tomato Chutney, Amla Chutney, Tamarind Chutney Sonth, sunflower seeds, watermelon seeds, roasted cumin powder, flaxseed powder, lemon juice, curry leaves, raisins",
  "instructions": "RAINBOW VEGGIES: Dice vegetables of your choice into small pieces: capsicum, 1 medium sized tomato, 1 small beetroot, 1 carrot. Add a pinch of hing (asafoetida), 1/4 tsp turmeric powder, 1/4 tsp saunf powder (fennel seeds powder), 1/4 tsp ground black pepper. Mix well. Microwave for 3-4 mins.\nLENTIL TOFU CHAAT: Add Lentil Tofu squares to microwaved Rainbow Veggies. Add some plant based yogurt, Tomato Chutney, Amla Chutney or Tamarind Chutney Sonth per taste. Sprinkle some overnight soaked seeds (sunflower seeds, watermelon seeds), roasted cumin powder, flaxseed powder, lemon juice, curry leaves & some raisins.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "microwave",
    "no-cook"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Add chutneys per taste.",
  "notes": "A recipe with BEANS (Lentil Tofu), RAINBOW VEGGIES (capsicum, tomato, beetroot, carrot), BERRIES (Amla Chutney), NUTS & SEEDS (flaxseed powder, watermelon seeds, sunflower seeds), SWEETENER (raisins), LIME-LEMON-VINEGAR (lemon juice), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
